WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:03.640
 I'm going to
share with you what

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:11.810
I intended to say if I
had been elected in 2016.

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:15.620
"My fellow Americans,
today, you sent a message

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.699
to the whole world".

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:27.000
Everybody will be knocked
down, the question

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.010
is, will you get back up?

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:37.760
I want to share my life
lessons with the hope

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:41.840
that it might help you, as
you navigate your own life.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:49.880
I made so many
gaffes and mistakes.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:55.040
There are steps you can take to
build confidence in yourself;

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:59.825
to begin to trust yourself about
the decisions you will make.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.590
This class is for
anyone, at any age, who

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:13.600
wants to think about building
a life of meaning and purpose;

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:16.360
of having a mission
that captures what

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.820
you're willing to stand up for.

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:22.960
Everyone, every one of you, has
the ability to be resilient.

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:28.110
I've been, you know,
reduced to tears,

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:30.810
i've been frustrated
beyond words,

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:33.720
but the lesson that I've
learned about getting back

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:36.060
up after setbacks
or disappointments,

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.610
is to first feel
the disappointment.

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.260
Don't pretend it didn't happen.

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:42.010
It did.

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:47.740
You have to authentically
dig deep to get back up.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:52.770
I'm Hillary Rodham Clinton,
and this is MasterClass.

